WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:06.172
It's Mayuko's fault!

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.968
Killing that person makes you bad!

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.636
Help me!

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:18.643
It's true. I'm the bad one.

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:20.854
I'm bad for living on.

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:23.982
For killing people and living on.

00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:25.650
I…

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:28.028
I…

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:31.656
I'm…

00:00:47.672 --> 00:00:50.717
From behind? How the hell did you do that?

00:00:57.182 --> 00:00:59.017
Honjo, you are…

00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:03.438
truly a God.

00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:06.191
Mayuko, are you all right?

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:09.360
Take that gun and go up the stairs.

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:13.615
Thank you, Honjo. Will you be all right?

00:01:14.532 --> 00:01:16.117
Oh, I'm fine.

00:01:26.628 --> 00:01:27.629
Honjo!

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:30.715
Mayuko! I'm up!

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:32.217
We won't die.

00:01:32.717 --> 00:01:34.719
We won't give in to this world!

00:01:35.637 --> 00:01:36.930
Honjo!

00:01:43.394 --> 00:01:45.105
You damn temptresses!

00:01:45.647 --> 00:01:48.608
Did no one tell you that murder is wrong?

00:01:48.733 --> 00:01:51.277
Even if you survive in this world,

00:01:51.402 --> 00:01:54.489
you won't find any happiness here!

00:01:54.572 --> 00:01:57.408
So, come and let's be happy.

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.285
Jump from the ledge with me--

00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:10.088
My neck! It hurts!

00:02:10.171 --> 00:02:12.507
I won't find happiness even if I survive?

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.176
I'm not so sure.

00:02:16.511 --> 00:02:20.431
I'd say I'm very happy at the moment.

00:02:25.353 --> 00:02:27.605
Meeting Honjo cleared things up for me.

00:02:28.106 --> 00:02:31.776
My reason for living
is to secure my own happiness.

00:02:32.777 --> 00:02:37.365
Commit suicide or get killed
and I won't be able to.

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:40.118
That's why I'll…

00:02:41.953 --> 00:02:43.621
stay determined and keep fighting.

